    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n26325" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">lessus</span></b> , acc. um (only in <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>acc. sing.</i>),
				m., <i>a wailing, cry, funeral
				lamentation</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">mulieres genas ne radunto, neve lessum funeris
					ergo habento,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cic.
					Leg. 2, 23, 59</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">but a false reading for pausam,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plaut. Truc. 4, 2, 18</span></i>
			.</div>
